<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Homestake Mining raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Homestake Mining raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette has raised its rating for Homestake Mining Co to market perform from underperform, a trading source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened off 1/8 to 14-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
